The “Alfa Plan” tariff can be activated by sending the relevant keywords to the short number 650:
For “Alfa Plan 12GB” — A12;
For “Alfa Plan 25GB” — A25;
For “Alfa Plan 40GB” — A40;
For “Alfa Plan 60GB” — A60;
For “Alfa Plan 120GB” — A120.
The cost of 1 SMS to 650 is 0.02 AZN. It is also possible to activate any “Alfa Plan” tariff package by dialing the corresponding USSD code or via the Azercell application:
*750*4*112# for “Alfa Plan 12GB”
*750* 4*125# for “Alfa Plan 25GB”
*750* 4*140# for “Alfa Plan 40GB”
*750* 4*1160# for “Alfa Plan 60GB”
*750* 4*1120# for “Alfa Plan 120GB”
When subscribing to the “Alfa Plan” tariff package, the subscription fee is deducted from the balance, while the bonuses are credited to the account.

If the bonuses provided within the “Alfa Plan” tariff are exhausted, but the validity period of the package has not yet expired, the service charges are calculated as follows:
1 minute of a domestic call costs 0.10 AZN;
1 MB = 0.05 AZN. • 1 SMS = 0.10 AZN (International: 0.25 AZN).

For information about bonuses:
By sending an empty SMS to the short number 2112 (The cost of the SMS is 0.15 AZN);
By dialing *111*1*7#YES (The cost of the USSD message is 0.15 AZN);
Via the “Azercell” mobile application (The application can be downloaded by dialing *110#YES).

