You can subscribe to the tariff only by presenting an official "War veteran" card issued by the relevant state bodies of the Republic of Azerbaijan, namely:
The Ministry of Defense;
The Ministry of Internal Affairs;
The Ministry of Justice;
The Ministry of Emergency Situations;
The State Security Service;
The Foreign Intelligence Service;
The State Border Service;
State Service for Mobilization and Conscription;
The Special State Security Service of the Republic of Azerbaijan;
Security Service of President of Azerbaijan Republic;
Special Communication and Information Security State Agency;
State Agency for Strategic Facilities Protection of the Republic of Azerbaijan, or a military identity card with a note on the passage of military service and participation in hostilities during the war. The procedure and sample for issuing the "War veteran" card were approved by the Cabinet of Ministers of the Republic of Azerbaijan decree.
You can subscribe to the tariff by visiting any Azercell Exclusive offices with the above documents and identity card.
